repository-code: "https://github.com/erinmagennis/condition-findings-builder"
keywords: [dysautonomia, ehlers-danlos, research-findings, open-data]
abstract: >-
  Method for building grounded, verifiable findings datasets from the biomedical literature of one condition area:
  retrieval, screening, extraction with verbatim quotes, identifier lookup at the authorities, checks with negative
  controls, packaging and a shipped verifier. Documentation is licensed CC BY 4.0 (LICENSE-docs).
